{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22330","headline":"金銮子晬日 · 白居易","name":"金銮子晬日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行年欲四十，有女曰金銮。\n生来始周岁，学坐未能言。\n慙非达者怀，未免俗情怜。\n从此累身外，徒云慰目前。\n若无夭折患，则有婚嫁牵。\n使我归山计，应迟十五年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22330.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22330","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}